@startuml
title Node-Agent restart | bounded Operator Type-2 fixture contract
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFD
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #2F5D7C
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #EAF4FF

actor "Test runner" as T
participant "Node-Agent\nCNI + Type-2 loops" as A
database "Durable CNI / export /\nimport journals" as J
participant "Kubernetes / CRI /\nOVN / OVS / Linux" as V
participant "Same attested\nGoBGP speaker" as G
participant "OVN/OVS + FRR\nworkload packet path" as P

== Before interruption ==
T -> A : collect fresh status and captured CNI ADD calls
A -> J : acknowledged endpoint and exact path receipts
A -> G : verify actual speaker identity and owned routes
note over A,V
  Root-private journals remain on the same worker.
  Installation/node, boot, namespace and configuration must match.
end note

== Agent replacement ==
T -> A : restart DaemonSet; verify new Pod\n(optional scoped force-crash verifies container restart)
A -> J : reopen original journals; replay/reconcile matching state
A -> V : current Pod/Node UID, READY sandbox,\nexact OVN/OVS and host attachment checks
V --> A : current identity and resource observations
A -> G : attest live peer and verify exact route ownership
alt matching identities, resolved intents, same speaker
  A -> A : restore acknowledged endpoints;\nresume fresh import/export reconciliation
  A -> J : retain same-speaker acknowledged UUID receipts
else uncertainty, conflict or unresolved mutation
  A -> A : report blocked recovery; no tuple adoption\nor resource recreation from CNI ADD replay
end

== Runner assertions, not readiness alone ==
T -> A : require newer RUNNING status; 4 export UUIDs,\nsame receipts and speaker; 1 imported route
T -> A : replay CHECK for captured endpoint identity
T -> T : compare captured ADD calls; no ADD replay
T -> P : subsequent bidirectional traffic + packet captures
P --> T : attributed OVN/OVS VXLAN packets
note over T,P
  The scoped runner does not assert uninterrupted service or a convergence SLA.
  Recovery assertions must pass before normal lifecycle cleanup continues.
end note

== Subsequent exact cleanup ==
T -> A : retire endpoint through CNI lifecycle
A -> V : delete only matching owned attachment / LSP / veth
A -> G : asynchronously withdraw exact owned UUIDs
T -> P : verify survivor traffic and route preservation
T -> T : drain remaining owned routes/resources;\nverify scoped absence and guarded fixture cleanup

legend bottom center
  Implemented fixture/test contract, not new live acceptance evidence.
  GoBGP exchanges routes; OVN/OVS forwards external VXLAN packets.
endlegend
@enduml
